			dependencies: ["7A05000000000103"]
			description: [
				"&8[ FIELD REPORT — THE COLD ONES ]&r"
				""
				"&7In the cold forests something tall keeps its distance. Every account agrees it leaves people alone, until someone gets too close or stares too long.&r"
				""
				"&8Objective: provoke one, and survive long enough to end it.&r"
