			description: [
				"&8[ FIELD REPORT — PERSONAL ]&r"
				""
				"&7I have stopped trusting what I see out here. The notes I wrote last week are in handwriting I do not recognise.&r"
				""
				"&8The field kits had ampoules for this. Use them sparingly. Shelter and sleep help more.&r"
